  <AG_RainyThunderstormMaker.label>gerador de temporal</AG_RainyThunderstormMaker.label>
  <!-- EN: A distributed cloud of mechanites is interwoven with the DNA of the carrier. These mechanites have the ability of drastically increasing electrostatic energy and lowering atmospheric pressure, causing a violent rainy thunderstorm to form. -->
