  <AG_DryThunderstormMaker.label>gerador de trovões</AG_DryThunderstormMaker.label>
  <!-- EN: A distributed cloud of mechanites is interwoven with the DNA of the carrier. These mechanites have the ability of drastically increasing electrostatic energy in the atmosphere, causing a violent dry thunderstorm to form. This does not make the carrier immune to lightning strikes! -->
  <AG_DryThunderstormMaker.description>Uma nuvem difusa de mecanitos está entrelaçada ao DNA do portador. Esses mecanitos aumentam drasticamente a energia eletrostática na atmosfera, formando uma violenta tempestade seca de raios. Isso não deixa o portador imune a raios!</AG_DryThunderstormMaker.description>
